# Layer 3, business flow "cache": AMPS as the remote persistent store for the
# cache-persistent-store module's local Map caches.
#
# Nothing here needs to differ from the repo defaults -- same ports, same
# binary, same platform. This file exists so every flow folder has the same
# two files and the layering order stays uniform; see
# docs/src/server-env-layering.md.
#
# No optional modules either: plain SOW topics (one with a composite key) are
# the whole configuration, so any AMPS build runs this flow.
